'''Scholar Alluin''' is an [[NPC]] found in the {{zone|Cathedral}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Scholar Alluin''' will hint that there is a book that can be taken out in the {{zone|Cathedral}}. This bookshelf can be found at {{coordinates|-10|127|-938}}, and will give numbers which will help to find the {{Item|Kuudra Relic}}.

